add('E.9','Mapping-path factorization needs universal source evaluation','Absent: no path object P(S), endpoint map or universally weak source evaluation is specified. 108 scan004’s pullback-preservation requirement is compatible motivation, but does not prove the transfer step needed for the mapping-path factorization.','chemin|factorisation|Loc.*7','DER_XVI.tex, Loc(7F); dossier PATHS E.5')
